        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kanloumeipu bammei Zion ramgai,",
            "Achun sinung ai ning touna ainiBam khang ninge;",
            "Kandih khou pui-pu lun thai mak,",
            "Kandih khou kiruai kum rianra sini,",
            "Ninge nang thuk pui jei.",
            "",
            "2. Ai jip chiang thao pui-pu lun thai maknga,",
            "Mikdui !-2 noudui phan sunaLung hei padik bam;",
            "Khou-mang pui-pu lun thai mak kum,",
            "Jangsi mikdui luangmei !-2 duan suna,",
            "Achun sina ai kap.",
            "",
            "3. Thou !-2 ata kanah kao lou nicho?",
            "Ai puai tatna apui ta kaokiDaoloumei makge;",
            "Abunga samei khuan tei,",
            "Apui khuan suna ai phu guang sini,",
            "Ata puang lou mak ge.",
            "",
            "4. Apui ata nban khou puan lou ki,",
            "Ai kap khou sumloumei makngaBui thang tat kan tu cho?",
            "Ai lat luna kapmei mikdui,",
            "Roulou nimei makge kandih khouhei,",
            "Dap tari kim mak ge."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
